  "body": "## What changed\r\n\r\nThis PR prepares the UI tests for the refit (#655). The goal of #1953: a refit PR updates small, named tests, and the cut gate does not need hours of retest.\r\n\r\n- **Named layout tests** (new `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/page_layout.rs`, 15 tests): `layout_shell`, `layout_shell_light`, `layout_page_stock`, `layout_page_wcs`, `layout_page_model`, `layout_page_tool_library`, `layout_page_tool`, `layout_page_operation`, `layout_page_setups`, `layout_page_setup_settings`, `layout_page_setup_machine`, `layout_page_setup_post`, `layout_page_setup_fixtures`, `layout_page_setup_tools`, `layout_window_debug_info`. Each test asserts a coarse law only: the anchor widgets of the page are inside the Properties leaf and stack top to bottom. A failure names the page.\r\n- **Shell skeleton split**: `structural::assert_shell_skeleton` now asserts presence, labels and the enabled state only. Its position clauses moved to `page_layout::assert_shell_layout`.\r\n- **No fixed screen points** (new `tests/anchors.rs`): `pane_center(tab)` and `chrome_point(avoid)` take the pointer target from the live layout. They replace `pos2(4,4)`, `pos2(1100,500)` (two tests) and `pos2(640,712)`. `model_incomplete` finds the status node by its text, not by `y > 600`.\r\n- **Rule**: root `AGENTS.md` (Testing) gets **A UI refit PR keeps its tests**. `crates/ui/AGENTS.md` restates it.\r\n- **Decisions**: `docs/decisions/1953-ui-refit-test-plan.md`.\r\n\r\nNo product code changed. No snapshot PNG changed.\r\n\r\n## Readings\r\n\r\nThe v0.20.0 cut evidence and the test inventory are in the comments on #1953. In the v0.20.0 release gate, no UI test failed. The cost of v0.19.0 was the regeneration of three pixel snapshots.\r\n\r\n## Pinning tests\r\n\r\n- The 15 `page_layout::layout_*` tests.\r\n- `structural::shell_structure_dark`, `structural::shell_structure_light` (behaviour-only skeleton).\r\n- `tests::click_outside_the_viewport_is_not_a_pick`, `tests::origin_page_shows_the_anchor_grid_and_arms_pick_mode`, `one_wcs::*`, `layout::the_viewport_row_is_inert_and_the_door_dismisses_outside`, `model_incomplete::*`.\r\n\r\n## Gate\r\n\r\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui` (cwd `crates/ui`): all binaries green. Lib: 831 passed, 6 ignored (837 tests; main has 822, so 15 were added and none were removed).\r\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\n- The full quick tier. The diff touches `AGENTS.md`, so `cargo xtask gate quick` selects every suite of every crate. This PR changes test code in `camcraft-ui` only, so only the UI suites and the UI clippy step ran.\r\n- Pixel snapshot lane (release tier).\r\n\r\n## Follow-ups (source:agent, P7)\r\n\r\n- #1988 AccessKit nodes for the painted ribbon cells; click them by label (about 35 tests).\r\n- #1989 AccessKit nodes for the painted browser rows; find them by label.\r\n- #1990 Remove the size and colour clauses from behaviour tests.\r\n- #1991 Named layout tests for the remaining windows and modals.\r\n- #1992 Some widgets sit past the right edge of the Properties pane at 1280 x 720 (a possible defect, to be checked).\r\n\r\n#1988 and #1989 need UI code changes, so this PR only refers to #1953 and does not close it.\r\n\r\nProcess change: yes\r\nEffort: high (no escalation)\r\nChangelog: none\r\n\r\nRefs #1953\r\n\r\n## Refresh\r\n\r\n- Old head: `1672130016b468b9bfaa5d61077af63249f952c2`.\r\n- New head: `b94b2dc9b225392debf10a6f0887474c3c644db8` (a merge of `origin/main` at `17a8c6e76`, no rebase, no force-push).\r\n- Resolved hunk: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`, the test module list. This PR added `mod page_layout;` and `mod anchors;`. Main added `mod waterjet_recipe;` at the same place. The resolution keeps the three lines. No logic changed.\r\n- `git diff origin/main --stat` lists only the files of this PR (10 files).\r\n- Tests on the new head (cwd `crates/ui`, `--test-threads=6`):\r\n  - `camcraft-ui` lib: 863 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored (snapshot lane).\r\n  - `page_layout::` 15 passed; `structural::` 10 passed; `waterjet_recipe::` 2 passed; `camera_target::` 2 passed.\r\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\r\n- Review: no collaborator `pr-reviewer` marker exists for any head of this PR. Thus there is no delta class. The PR needs a full review.\r\n\r\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\r\n",
